1, "impression_count": 2709, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Global electricity demand is set to grow at a faster pace in 2026 than the recent average – and accelerate further in 2027.\n\nIndustry, air conditioning, EVs &amp; data centres continue to drive up demand amid energy market turmoil.\n\nMore 👉 https://t.co/Zc84EeOVRa https://t.co/Ioxy92jDI2", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2115032027246301456"}, {"author_id": "45483286", "created_at": "2026-10-27T09:59:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115020490805060087"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 194, "start": 190, "tag": "IBM"}], "hashtags": [{"end": 203, "start": 195, "tag": "Rapidus"}, {"end": 219, "start": 204, "tag": "semiconductors"}], "urls": [{"description": "日本IBMは27日までに、北海道千歳市に新たに事業所を開設したと発表した。先端半導体の量産を目指すラピダスなど、半導体関連企業への支援を強化するとともに、半導体関連企業が集まる北海道で新規顧客の開拓", "display_url": "nikkei.com/article/DGXZQO…", "end": 243, "expanded_url": "https://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXZQOUC26AQQ0W6A021C2000000/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114888275446149120/0ayGGVAC?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114888275446149120/0ayGGVAC?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 220, "status": 200, "title": "日本IBM、北海道千歳市に新事業所　ラピダスなど半導体顧客向け", "unwound_url": "https://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXZQOUC26AQQ0W6A021C2000000/", "url": "https://t.co/fbBCRObzUr"}]}, "id": "2115020490805060087", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 6641, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "IBM Japan opened an office in Chitose, Japan near state-backed foundry Rapidus as the two work together on 2nm mass production, media report. The two are also working on advanced packaging. $IBM #Rapidus #semiconductors https://t.co/fbBCRObzUr", "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2115020490805060087"}, {"author_id": "45483286", "created_a