114889332473708834"], "id": "2114889332473708834", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 6425, "like_count": 49, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Nvidia has been working with key supplier Foxconn—the world’s biggest AI server and iPhone assembler—to turn its 200+ global manufacturing plants into self-learning smart factories using AI, media report. Foxconn has revealed major initial results:\n-Slashed assembly-line defect", "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2114889332473708834"}, {"author_id": "45483286", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:35:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114878729809973736"], "id": "2114878729809973736", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 6428, "like_count": 71, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Taiwan’s semiconductor industry will account for 30% of the nation’s total electricity consumption by 2035, and state-run TaiPower plans to invest NT$30 billion (US$920M) over 15-years to strengthen direct power delivery to industrial parks to meet demand, media report.\n\nTaiwan’s", "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2114878729809973736"}, {"author_id": "17468569", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:25:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114876001054527675"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/vjX5IbRunL", "end": 107, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2114876001054527675/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114875861099016192", "start": 84, "url": "https://t.co/vjX5IbRunL"}]}, "id": "2114876001054527675", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 216, "impression_count": 101476, "like_count": 1682, "quote_count": 9, "reply_count": 59, "retweet_count": 33}, "text": "You know how sometimes you hear certain words and it's hard to contain yourself.... https://t.co/vjX5IbRunL", "url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2114876001054527675"}, {"author_id": "45483286", "created_at": "2026-10-26T23:47:22.000Z", "edit_history_tw