ystems\n\nAnd as electrification advances, it could evolve into an everyday tool for boosting system resilience &amp; efficiency\n\nOur report looks at how to unlock these benefits: https://t.co/fWJI2BVRt1 https://t.co/wtLZxDl04e", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2114835731885502827"}, {"author_id": "17468569", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:41:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114834793296978182"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/RyanBethencour…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/RyanBethencourt/status/2114701737307087047", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/7MH1yA4Qla"}]}, "id": "2114834793296978182", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 761, "impression_count": 167710, "like_count": 1887, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 74, "retweet_count": 93}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114701737307087047", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Extends the medium lifespan of male mice by 22.5% and 35% in female mice. \n\nIt's a few years old, I posted about it in 2024.\n\nShowed IL-11 as a driver of aging, and tissue inflammation and fibrosis. It climbed up with age, and was linked to fat build up and muscle loss. \n\nIt is https://t.co/7MH1yA4Qla", "url": "https://x.com/bryan_johnson/status/2114834793296978182"}, {"author_id": "166252256", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:40:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114834663352983751"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/7PYI0OYsgB", "end": 107, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2114834663352983751/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114834637360881664", "start": 84, "url": "https://t.co/7PYI0OYsgB"}]}, "id": "2114834663352983751", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 53, "impression_count": 60123, "like_count": 1152, "quote_count": 18, "reply_count": 79, "retweet_count": 223}, "text": "“You Can See Everything.”\n\n…Except where reliable energy was supposed to come from. https://t.co/7PYI0OYsgB", "url": "https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2114834663352983751"}, {"author_id": "17026589", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:26:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114831025419288956"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 36, "id": "5694822", "start": 26, "username": "Princeton"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Y9sYkCVkmR", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JesseJenkins/status/2114831025419288956/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114830620278812673", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/Y9sYkCVkmR"}]}, "id": "2114831025419288956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3551, "like_count": 65, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Some hot heat pumps here! @Princeton's large ground source heat pump building (with two integrated thermal energy storage tanks provide hours of demand flexibility visible at left). Clean, quiet, extremely efficient and looks nice in the glorious fall light. https://t.co/Y9sYkCVkmR", "url": "https://x.com/JesseJenkins/status/2114831025419288956"}, {"author_id": "19386622", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:17:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114828854061588540"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 78, "start": 73, "tag": "UNSC"}], "mentions": [{"end": 36, "id": "2911144905", "start": 22, "username": "rafaelmgrossi"}, {"end": 55, "id": "14159148", "start": 52, "username": "UN"}], "urls": [{"description": "Non-proliferation - Security Council, 10253rd meeting", "display_url": "webtv.un.org/en/asset/k1j/k…", "end": 230, "expanded_url": "https://webtv.un.org/en/asset/k1j/k1j48hm4wh", "images": [{"height": 317, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114828854464335872/WxOIhMqu?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 564}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114828854464335872/WxOIhMqu?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 207, "status": 200, "title": "Non-proliferation - Security Council, 10253rd meeting", "unwound_url": "https://webtv.un.org/en/asset/k1j/k1j48hm4wh", "url": "https://t.co/BMnocPrVSl"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/f3CcvB8dc9", "end": 254, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2114828854061588540/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114828848348950528", "start": 231, "url": "https://t.co/f3CcvB8dc9"}]}, "id": "2114828854061588540", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 4278, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "IAEA Director General @rafaelmgrossi will brief the @UN Security Council #UNSC on current nuclear non-proliferation issues tomorrow, Tuesday 27 October, at 10AM New York time / 3PM Vienna time.\n\nWatch live: https://t.co/BMnocPrVSl https://t.co/f3CcvB8dc9", "url": "https://x.com/iaeaorg/status/2114828854061588540"}, {"author_id": "61559439", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:14:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114827978748383342"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 103, "id": "932729913202880512", "start": 93, "username": "SimBioSys"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/mbzSeRnE8l", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114827978748383342/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114827948523995136", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/mbzSeRnE8l"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/mbzSeRnE8l", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114827978748383342/video/1", "media_key": "3_2114827948398170113", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/mbzSeRnE8l"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/mbzSeRnE8l", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114827978748383342/video/1", "media_key": "3_2114827948385542144", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/mbzSeRnE8l"}]}, "id": "2114827978748383342", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 53, "impression_count": 76467, "like_count": 496, "quote_count": 14, "reply_count": 79, "retweet_count": 69}, "text": "After a breast cancer diagnosis, one of the hardest questions is whether it will come back.\n\n@SimBioSys is helping doctors and patients better understand that risk. Powered by NVIDIA technology, its FDA-cleared TumorSight Risk analyzes an existing breast MRI alongside pathology https://t.co/mbzSeRnE8l", "url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114827978748383342"}, {"author_id": "17026589", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:10:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114811940501656047"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Investing in clean energy, efficiency and electrification is the only path to get us there.", "display_url": "nytimes.com/2022/05/14/opi…", "end": 200, "expanded_url": "https://www.nytimes.com/2022/05/14/opinion/gas-prices-oil-renewable-energy-drilling.html", "images": [{"height": 1688, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114811944553316353/ytXk255f?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 3000}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114811944553316353/ytXk255f?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 177, "status": 200, "title": "Opinion | We Can’t Drill Our Way to Energy Security (Published 2022)", "unwound_url": "https://www.nytimes.com/2022/05/14/opinion/gas-prices-oil-renewable-energy-drilling.html", "url": "https://t.co/0APmpCL2gs"}, {"display_url": "x.com/laurimyllyvirt…", "end": 224, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/laurimyllyvirta/status/2114704158984990999", "start": 201, "url": "https://t.co/b58wLCNAwS"}]}, "id": "2114811940501656047", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 6269, "like_count": 78, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 24}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114704158984990999", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Energy dominance eh? \nTurns out, you can't drill your way to energy security, as I wrote in 2022 when we were in the midst of the LAST global oil &amp; gas supply disruption... https://t.co/0APmpCL2gs https://t.co/b58wLCNAwS", "url": "https://x.com/JesseJenkins/status/2114811940501656047"}, {"author_id": "17026589", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:07:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114811209186689506"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/aniruddh_mohan…", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/aniruddh_mohan/status/2114733407318028419", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/KYkHYWCQSn"}]}, "id": "2114811209186689506", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 126, "impression_count": 25839, "like_count": 230, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 50}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114733407318028419", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Behind the meter gas power has become a common path for data centers to get power faster. But it turns out operating a city-scale utility is no joke (turbine shafts breaking, low uptimes). It's hell for social licenes (if you think communities hate data centers, try data centers https://t.co/KYkHYWCQSn", "url": "https://x.com/JesseJenkins/status/2114811209186689506"}, {"author_id": "17026589", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:04:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114810511363866708"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/AndrewDamitio/…", "end": 64, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/AndrewDamitio/status/2114703605882094016", "start": 41, "url": "https://t.co/SLmuELLXh2"}]}, "id": "2114810511363866708", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 5780, "like_count": 52, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114703605882094016", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Sim City. But realistic. And terrible... https://t.co/SLmuELLXh2", "url": "https://x.com/JesseJenkins/status/2114810511363866708"}, {"author_id": "325581008", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:00:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114779283981754721"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/6dSpiOInQ1", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NRCgov/status/2114779283981754721/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114779280915779584", "start": 270, "url": "https://t.co/6dSpiOInQ1"}]}, "id": "2114779283981754721", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 803, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "📍 Commissioner Marzano and agency senior managers recently visited the Comanche Peak Nuclear Power Plant in Glen Rose, Texas. These visits help NRC leadership gain firsthand insight into plant operations and support our work to safely regulate nuclear power nationwide. https://t.co/6dSpiOInQ1", "url": "https://x.com/NRCgov/status/2114779283981754721"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "57111966", "name": "EIA", "username": "EIAgov"}, {"id": "80513844", "name": "ASML", "username": "ASMLcompany"}, {"id": "19386622", "name": "IAEA - International Atomic Energy Agency ⚛️", "username": "iaeaorg"}, {"id": "84679163", "name": "International Energy Agency", "username": "IEA"}, {"id": "45483286", "name": "Dan Nystedt", "username": "dnystedt"}, {"id": "17468569", "name": "Bryan Johnson", "username": "bryan_johnson"}, {"id": "16933019", "name": "AukeHoekstra", "username": "AukeHoekstra"}, {"id": "166252256", "name": "U.S. Department of Energy", "username": "ENERGY"}, {"id": "17026589", "name": "Jesse D. Jenkins", "username": "JesseJenkins"}, {"id": "61559439", "name": "NVIDIA", "username": "nvidia"}, {"id": "325581008", "name": "NRC", "username": "NRCgov"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2115058047164838343", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlx9374pihy0d2zif6qvxb92h6d9", "oldest_id": "2114779283981754721", "result_count": 25}}
